  "title": "Indian Vegetable Bhaji",
  "description": "In this Indian dry curry, potatoes, cauliflower, carrots and peas are fried and flavored with spices, garlic, and chiles. It's perfect as a side dish for an Indian dinner.",
  "authors": [
    "NP"
  ],
